/target
.DS_Store
__pycache__/

# The experiment pipeline (python -m experiment.pipeline) writes
# experiment/runs/<experiment>/. Simulated genomes (psmcfa, VCF, masks, tree
# sequences, TMRCA tracks) are large and regenerated exactly from the seeds
# recorded in truth/ and provenance/; logs and the runner's state are local.
# Fits (.psmc, JSON), truth and provenance records, tables and figures are
# small and committed. psmc-rs writes an HTML report next to every JSON, and
# interrupted runs leave *.partial files: neither is kept.
/experiment/runs/*/sims/
/experiment/runs/*/logs/
/experiment/runs/_runner/
/experiment/runs/**/*.html
/experiment/runs/**/*.partial
# The inputs E2 and E7 prepare (the smaller profiles' prefixes of E2's
# genomes; E7's psmcfa, masks and VCFs) are regenerable. E7's data stage ran
# on the cluster; its manifest and records (how each chromosome was read,
# the pilot) are the provenance of its inputs, and its sample table and chunk
# plan are what E7's job graph reads.
/experiment/runs/**/inputs/*
!/experiment/runs/E7/inputs/MANIFEST.json
!/experiment/runs/E7/inputs/records/
!/experiment/runs/E7/inputs/samples.tsv
!/experiment/runs/E7/inputs/chunks.tsv
# Runs of the pipeline's smoke profile, the tools it builds or finds (C psmc
# and its utilities), its Python environment, and the frozen laptop run that
# crossplatform/ and c_equivalence/ read.
/experiment/.runs-smoke/
/experiment/.tools
/experiment/.venv
/experiment/.production
# What a re-run of crossplatform/ leaves beside its kept results.
/experiment/crossplatform/bin/
/experiment/crossplatform/logs*/
/experiment/crossplatform/runs*/**/*.html
# E5 (bootstrap calibration) keeps every bootstrap replicate's parameters
# (replicate_NNN.json) and psmc-rs's summary; the replicates' .psmc files
# (every EM round, about 0.1 MB each, a thousand of them) are not kept.
/experiment/runs/E5/boot/**/replicate_*.psmc
# E2 and E7 keep the same of their bootstraps (main.json, replicate_NNN.json,
# summary.json and summary.tsv), not the replicates' .psmc files.
/experiment/runs/E2/bootstrap/**/replicate_*.psmc
/experiment/runs/E7/boot/**/replicate_*.psmc

# Site settings of the SLURM scripts (account, paths)
/experiment/slurm/site.env

# manuscript builds (make in manuscript/)
/manuscript/build/
